//- TAKEOVER RIGHT RAIL - THE APP'S ACTIVITY FEED, LIVING WHERE THE MEMBERS
//- PANE DOES IN MIRROR MODE (SAME #memberContainer, HOUSE ID-REUSE
//- CONVENTION), SO EVERY EXISTING SWAP PATH RESTORES MEMBERS WHOLESALE ON
//- BACK-OUT. THE FEED BODY IS ITS OWN FRAGMENT (appFeedBody) FOR HEARTBEAT
//- PUSHES. ADD-NEW SEARCH LIVES IN THE LIBRARY/RELEASES SURFACES, NOT HERE.
//- LOCALS: activeApp, feed { rows, hasMore, error? }
div.memberContainer.appFeed#memberContainer(
  hx-select-oob="#memberContainer"
  hx-swap-oob="outerHTML"
)
  include appFeedBody
